within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.C_CardiovascularSystem.C09A_AceInhibitorsPlain.C09AA16_Imidapril;
model Imidapril_Harder1997_PD_ace
  "emax exposure-response sweep — Harder_1997 :: ACE (ACE-activity)"
  extends Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep(
    E0 = 1.04613961342e-22,      // [kg/m3; u.l -1 × 1.66054e-24]
    Emax = -7.30637190325e-23,  // [kg/m3; u.l -1 × 1.66054e-24]
    EC50 = 2.7e-06,  // [kg/m3; ng ml -1 × 1e-06]
    gamma = 1,
    exposure_per_s = 1e-06);   // 1 ng ml -1 per second
  // imax_as_negative_emax: Imax (Q323) enters SigmoidEmaxSweep as −Emax
  // defaulted: gamma
  annotation(experiment(StartTime = 0, StopTime = 27, Interval = 0.054),
    Documentation(info = "<html><body><h4>Imidapril_Harder1997_PD_ace</h4><p>The steady-state exposure-response curve of Harder S et al., <i>British journal of clinical pharmacology 43(5):475–480</i> 1997 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1046/j.1365-2125.1997.00588.x\">doi:10.1046/j.1365-2125.1997.00588.x</a>) — ACE-activity [u.l -1] against imidaprilat ng ml -1 — obtained by sweeping the driver instead of simulating a dose. Model family: emax.</p><h4>The parameters, in the paper's terms</h4><pre>  E0    =         63 u.l -1   drug-free response (baseline) (E0, Q324)
  Emax  =         44 u.l -1   maximal effect term (E max, Q323)
  EC50  =        2.7 ng ml -1 exposure at half of the maximal effect term (Ec 50, Q322)
  gamma = (library default) Hill coefficient</pre><p>The algebra is <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Pharmacodynamic.SigmoidEmaxSweep\">SigmoidEmaxSweep</a>; this model only supplies the numbers. The x axis is one ng ml -1 of imidaprilat per second of simulated time (exposure is in kg/m3): there is no state, no dose and no kinetics — plot <code>response</code> against <code>exposure</code> (or <code>time</code>).</p><h4>What it reproduces</h4><pre>  exposure = 0         response 1.046e-22   (drug-free)
  exposure = EC50 (2.7 ng ml -1)  response 6.808e-23
  exposure -> infinity  response 3.155e-23</pre></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Harder_1997: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: accepted with caveats</li></ul></body></html>"));
end Imidapril_Harder1997_PD_ace;
